   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Oak Park, Michigan, USA, 14 February 2026, Volunteers collect food and other items for immigrants threatened by ICE. The Valentine's Day collection was called Love Without Borders: Valentine Care for Immigrant Neighbors. (Photo by: Jim West/UCG/Universal Images Group via Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
